# ---- what one ratio can hold ----

"the shape of the failures" ^0
"  tenants that saw any failure : " ^0
"    " + str(tenants_with_any_failure_at_all) + " of " + str(tenants) ^0
"  failures belonging to a single tenant : " ^0
